{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108282","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108282","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1710828201:1":{"text":"マーチン！現状の報告を！","source_cn":"马丁！汇报情况！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDDF175645DAD03F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710828202:1":{"text":"隊長！来てくださったのですね！現状は、かなり緊迫しております……！","source_cn":"队长！您来了！太好了！报告队长，情况有些糟糕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7D1537BAAFB99DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710828203:1":{"text":"先ほど、古聖堂で何かとんでもないことが起きたらしくて……突然、魔物と深淵の裂目が現れたんです！","source_cn":"刚才圣古堂那边似乎出了什么大事，紧接着魔物和深渊裂隙就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC5C97A6B012DDF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710828204:1":{"text":"今のところなんとか持ちこたえていますが、魔物が増え続ければ、これ以上は人々を守り切れないかもしれません……！","source_cn":"我们虽然暂时护住了周边的民众，但魔物越来越多，所以有点...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3863818542D2DEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710828205:1":{"text":"ここにとどまるのは危険です。開けた地形で包囲されたら、逃げ場がなくなってしまう……","source_cn":"不能原地死守，这里地形开阔，一旦被围攻就是死路一条。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83F0DB2C9FE8F47E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710828206:1":{"text":"直ちに移動しましょう。安全区域はどこですか？","source_cn":"必须立刻转移，现在的安全区在哪里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x819830026152209F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710828207:1":{"text":"野外劇場の方は比較的安全だと、仲間が信号弾で教えてくれました。宮廷魔術師も支援に来ているそうです。","source_cn":"有同僚发信号说露天剧场那边暂时安全，还有宫廷魔法师在那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66E63FBECFF945A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710828208:1":{"text":"ですが、隊長……劇場へ向かう道は、どこも魔物だらけです。大勢を連れて動くのは危険ですよ……！","source_cn":"可是队长……通往剧场的路全是魔物，带着这么多民众硬闯，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA119C9BCE43813B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710828209:1":{"text":"他に選択肢はありません。直ちに移動します！","source_cn":"没有别的选择，得立刻转移！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x032C042D059A9C4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710828210:1":{"text":"総員、突撃準備！","source_cn":"听我命令！全员准备突围！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x307EF2EBE11021E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710828211:1":{"text":"私が道を開きます！非戦闘員は真ん中に集まってください！","source_cn":"我在最前方开路，民众们跟在中间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x081E926C155561E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710828212:1":{"text":"マーチン、あなたは殿を！魔物一匹たりとも近づけてはなりません！","source_cn":"马丁，你带人负责殿后。绝不能让任何一只魔物靠近民众！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3817D0983A6A24F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710828213:1":{"text":"はっ！","source_cn":"是！队长！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F67E8ADF9540FE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军马丁":{"text":"守備軍のマーチン","source":"守备军马丁","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}